<title>USA: EDS Corp Q4 shr flat. [CORRECTED 22:42 GMT]</title>
<headline>EDS Corp Q4 shr flat. [CORRECTED 22:42 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.56		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			272,800		  269,500</p>
