<p> Revs		  14,441,300	     12,422,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 net includes a one-time, $850 million charge from Q2, and $45.5 million in costs related to EDS' split-off last June from its former parent, General Motors Corp. Exluding those charges and costs, earnings per share for the 1996 fiscal year were $2.07 (corrects from $1.96).</p>
<p>Full company name is Electronic Data Systems Corp</p>
